#: dist/wpmediaverse/includes/Admin/Settings/SettingsRegistrar.php:370
#: includes/Admin/Settings/SettingsRegistrar.php:398
msgid "Compress uploaded images"
msgstr ""

#: dist/wpmediaverse/includes/Admin/Settings/SettingsRegistrar.php:376
#: includes/Admin/Settings/SettingsRegistrar.php:404
msgid ""
"Shrink each uploaded image automatically by removing hidden camera data and "
"re-saving with stronger compression. Works on JPEG, PNG, and GIF. Most "
"uploads end up 10 to 30 percent smaller with no visible quality change. If "
"you already use EWWW, Imagify, Smush, or ShortPixel, leave this on; they "
"will run alongside."
msgstr ""

#: dist/wpmediaverse/includes/Admin/Settings/SettingsRegistrar.php:394
#: includes/Admin/Settings/SettingsRegistrar.php:422
msgid "Create WebP copies for faster loading"
msgstr ""

#: dist/wpmediaverse/includes/Admin/Settings/SettingsRegistrar.php:400
#: includes/Admin/Settings/SettingsRegistrar.php:428
msgid ""
"Save a second copy of every image in WebP format. WebP files are about 25 "
"to 35 percent smaller than JPEG, so pages load faster for your visitors. "
"Browsers that support WebP use the smaller file; older browsers keep using "
"the original. Already have older uploads to optimize? Visit a media item "
"and use Re-optimize, or ask your developer to run the bulk optimizer "
"command."
msgstr ""

#: dist/wpmediaverse/includes/Admin/Settings/SettingsRegistrar.php:420
#: includes/Admin/Settings/SettingsRegistrar.php:448
msgid "Create AVIF copies for the smallest possible files"
msgstr ""

#: dist/wpmediaverse/includes/Admin/Settings/SettingsRegistrar.php:426
#: includes/Admin/Settings/SettingsRegistrar.php:454
msgid ""
"Save a third copy of every image in the newer AVIF format. AVIF is around "
"30 to 50 percent smaller than WebP, so pages load even faster on modern "
"browsers (Chrome, Firefox, Safari 16.4+, Edge). Older browsers fall back to "
"WebP, then the original. Encoding AVIF is much slower than WebP so uploads "
"will take longer. Requires a host with AVIF-capable Imagick or GD; the "
"option will silently no-op if the server cannot encode AVIF."
msgstr ""

#: dist/wpmediaverse/includes/Admin/Settings/SettingsRegistrar.php:446
#: includes/Admin/Settings/SettingsRegistrar.php:474
msgid "Help improve WPMediaVerse"
msgstr ""

#: dist/wpmediaverse/includes/Admin/Settings/SettingsRegistrar.php:452
#: includes/Admin/Settings/SettingsRegistrar.php:480
msgid ""
"Allow this site to record anonymous usage counters locally. Only event "
"names are counted (e.g. \"thumbnail_generated\", \"rest:media:GET\") — "
"never user IDs, URLs, file paths, or media content. The counters stay on "
"this site; nothing is transmitted. The plugin team will ask you to share "
"the counter report manually when they need data to make a "
"backwards-compatibility decision. Disabled by default."
msgstr ""

